    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Voice Transcription\n \n**\"Download the voice file and transcribe it to text \"**  \n\n\n*Explains:* Uses OpenAI Whisper to convert voice messages to plain text.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 300
